{"id":"366b48b6c0917152","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-miller-yu.md","title":"Miller–Yu 的普通复杂度刻画","display":"thm-miller-yu — Miller–Yu 的普通复杂度刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-miller-yu","aliases":["43-thm-miller-yu"],"display":"thm-miller-yu — Miller–Yu 的普通复杂度刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-kolm]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.8 Theorem 9.8.2，印刷195–197，PDF215–217","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-miller-yu"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-miller-yu</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-miller-yu — Miller–Yu 的普通复杂度刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.8 Theorem 9.8.2，印刷195–197，PDF215–217"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为固定最优普通复杂度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为固定最优前缀复杂度（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n)\">\\(K(n)\\)</span> 使用固定整数编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-K(n)-c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-K(n)-c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(g)\\land\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}2^{-g(n)}&lt;\\infty\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-g(n)-c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(g)\\land\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}2^{-g(n)}&lt;\\infty\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;C(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge n-g(n)-c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>常数可依赖X和g，不要求求和有可计算收敛模。修正草稿证明里K(n)≤g(n)−O(1)的符号排印为实际需要的≤g(n)+O(1)，陈述不受影响。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.8 Theorem 9.8.2，印刷195–197，PDF215–217。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$C$ 为固定最优普通复杂度，$K$ 为固定最优前缀复杂度（see [[43-df-kolm]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]）。$K(n)$ 使用固定整数编码；$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。 $\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"